1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,225
W: Hey, I heard you finally landed yourself a job.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,230
How did you manage to do that?

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,845
M: Well, it's a bit funny how I got this job.

4
00:00:08,135 --> 00:00:16,080
I mean, I searched all the employment agencies and had been reading the classified ads section of the newspaper every day for the last few weeks without having any luck.

5
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:21,900
Then, I got this phone call from a friend of mine I hadn't talked to since I graduated from college.

6
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,840
He told me that he started a company and he wanted me to help him out.

7
00:00:26,495 --> 00:00:28,600
W: Wow, that is a bit far-fetched.

8
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:31,200
How long has it been since you graduated?

9
00:00:31,665 --> 00:00:32,680
M: It's been four years.

10
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:37,360
I guess I am really lucky to get this chance since the job market is terrible nowadays.
